\f0\b \cf0 Simple Explanation:
\f1\b0 \

\f0\b Exact Match Keywords:
\f1\b0  Google will give impression to Standard Search campaign\

\f0\b Phrase and Broad Match Keywords:
\f1\b0  Google will give impression to highest ad rank (could be either PMax or Standard Search)\
